# 文件功能：忽略平台仓库在本地开发、构建、调试过程中产生的临时文件、依赖目录、环境变量文件与构建产物。

# OS / Editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# Logs
*.log
logs/
.codex-run-logs/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Tool caches
.codex/
.qoder/
.cache/

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
deploy/runtime.env

# 部署共享密钥（Backend/Renderer 服务身份凭证），禁止入库
deploy/secrets/
**/secrets/render_service_credential

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyd
*.so
.python-version
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# Node.js / Frontend
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.npm/
dist/
.vite/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
runtime/.runtime-build-id
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Backend artifacts
backend/build_artifacts/
backend/data/
backend/output.txt
backend/test_output.txt
backend/test_result.txt

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
.tmp/
*.tmp
# 动画实验的运行证据只留在本地，仓库只保留可重跑夹具、协议和候选
tests/experiments/**/evidence/
# 测试机可再生产物不入库；历史演练只保留 summary.md 与 evidence-manifest，摘要记录 sha256
docs/archive/architecture-2026-09/runs/**/*.zip
docs/archive/architecture-2026-09/runs/**/*.png
docs/archive/architecture-2026-09/runs/**/*.log
docs/archive/architecture-2026-09/runs/**/*.txt
docs/archive/architecture-2026-09/runs/**/*.json
!docs/archive/architecture-2026-09/runs/**/evidence-manifest.json
.workbuddy/
